# Training Pipeline — Complete Design

## Architecture

```
Every 30 min (market hours, auto)     Operator click (manual)
         │                                    │
         ▼                                    ▼
POST /training/snapshot (source="auto")   POST /training/snapshot (source="manual")
  - regime from _compute_regime()           - regime from d.regime (authoritative)
  - reads _last_kill_shots_result cache     - fallback: inferRegime() heuristic
  - skips if result > 35 min old           
         │                                    │
         └──────────────┬─────────────────────┘
                        ▼
              training_snapshots.jsonl
              pending_outcomes.json (index)
                        │
                        ▼ (3 days later)
              GET /training/pending-outcomes
              → overdue[] with days_overdue field
                        │
                        ▼
              Operator opens OutcomePanel
              Fills: P&L %, source (REQUIRED ≥3 chars)
              Clicks WIN / FLAT / LOSS
                        │
                        ▼
              POST /training/outcome
              Quality gates:
                - outcome ∈ {WIN, LOSS, NEUTRAL}
                - pnl_pct ∈ [-50, 50]
                - source.strip().length ≥ 3 (422 if empty)
                        │
                        ▼
              JSONL record patched in-place
              pending_outcomes.json updated
                        │
                        ▼
              GET /training/export?complete_only=true
              → JSONL download (only records with outcomes)
              → Export button appears when complete_records ≥ 50
```

## Regime Labeling — Authoritative Source

`_compute_regime(layers, kill_chain_result)` in `main.py`:
- Uses already-fetched data: `vix`, `rsi_14`, `spy_change_pct`, `kill_chain.verdict`
- No new API calls
- Injected into kill-shots-live response as `regime` field
- Frontend `inferRegime()` uses `d.regime` first, falls back to verdict heuristic

### Regime Rules
```
WAR_VETO in verdict                    → STRONG_DOWNTREND
vix > 28 AND spy_chg < -0.8%          → STRONG_DOWNTREND
vix > 22 AND spy_chg < -0.4%          → DOWNTREND
spy_chg < -0.3% OR rsi < 38           → DOWNTREND
|spy_chg| < 0.15% AND vix < 22        → CHOPPY
spy_chg > 0.6% AND rsi > 62           → STRONG_UPTREND
spy_chg > 0.25% OR rsi > 55           → UPTREND
default                                → CHOPPY
```

## Historical Data — Real Findings (Dec 2025, 1h OHLC backfill)

### What we found
- dp_learning.db had 307 BOUNCE outcomes with max_move_pct = 0.3/0.4 (HARDCODED thresholds, not real moves)
- Backfilled using Yahoo Finance 1h OHLC bars (344 bars/symbol for Dec 2025)
- Timestamps confirmed as ET local time

### Real win rates (resistance bounces, FROM_BELOW)
| Filter | n | Tradeable (≥0.2%) | CI |
|--------|---|-------------------|----|
| All resistance bounces | 119 | 37.0% | — |
| MORNING | 46 | 21.7% | — |
| MIDDAY | 35 | 14.3% | — |
| **AFTERNOON** | **38** | **76.3%** | **[61-87%]** |
| touch_count ≥ 14 | 34 | 70.6% | [54-83%] |
| AFTERNOON + tc ≥ 14 | 15 | **100%** | [80-100%] |
| QQQ resistance | 43 | 53.0% | — |

### Support bounces (FROM_ABOVE)
- 3.7% tradeable — essentially broken in Dec 2025 (downtrend context)
- Do NOT trade support bounces without regime filter

### Key insight
The "82.5% bounce rate" was categorical (price didn't break through level), not tradeable.
Real tradeable rate for the best filter: **76.3% (AFTERNOON resistance, n=38, CI: 61-87%)**.

## Similar Setups Strip

`GET /training/similar-setups?regime=&direction=&days=30`
- Scans complete JSONL records (have outcome) matching regime + direction
- Returns: `{ count, wins, losses, neutral, win_rate, avg_pnl_pct }`
- Frontend shows strip only when count ≥ 3
- Color: green WR>55%, amber 45-55%, red <45%

## Quality Gate on Outcome Recording

Backend (422 if violated):
1. `outcome` ∈ {WIN, LOSS, NEUTRAL}
2. `pnl_pct` ∈ [-50, 50]
3. `source.strip().length ≥ 3` — describe where P&L came from

Frontend:
- Source text input required before WIN/FLAT/LOSS buttons enable
- Input border turns green when source is valid (≥3 chars)

## API Endpoints

```
POST /api/v1/training/snapshot
  Body: { payload, label, note, regime, symbol, confidence, signal_type, direction, source }
  Returns: { snapshot_id, outcome_due_date, total_records, complete_records, pending_outcome_count }

POST /api/v1/training/outcome
  Body: { snapshot_id, outcome, pnl_pct, days_elapsed, source (required ≥3 chars) }
  Returns: { status, complete_records }
  Errors: 422 if quality gate violated

GET /api/v1/training/pending-outcomes
  Returns: { overdue_count, upcoming_count, overdue: [...days_overdue field...], upcoming: [...] }

GET /api/v1/training/similar-setups?regime=&direction=&days=30
  Returns: { count, wins, losses, neutral, win_rate, avg_pnl_pct }

GET /api/v1/training/historical-summary
  Returns: honest summary of dp_learning.db + snapshots + gate_backtest

GET /api/v1/training/auto-status
  Returns: { auto_snapshots_total, manual_snapshots_total, auto_snapshots_today, is_market_hours }

GET /api/v1/training/export?complete_only=true
  Returns: JSONL download (only records with outcomes)

GET /api/v1/training/status
  Returns: { total_records, complete_records, pending_outcome_count, overdue_outcome_count }
```

## Autonomous Capture Loop

`_auto_snapshot_loop()` in `main.py`:
- asyncio task started at server startup
- Runs every 30 min during market hours (9:30am–4pm ET, Mon–Fri)
- Reads `_last_kill_shots_result` cache (populated by kill-shots-live endpoint)
- Skips if: result > 35 min old, last auto-save < 25 min ago, market closed
- source = "auto" in JSONL record

## Remaining Gaps

1. **spy_change_pct in layers** — `_compute_regime()` reads `layers.get("spy_change_pct")` but this field may not be populated by all scorer paths. If 0.0, regime defaults to CHOPPY. Fix: add SPY daily change to TechScorer output.
2. **DOWNTREND/CHOPPY validation** — All Dec 2025 data is in a downtrend context. AFTERNOON resistance rule (76.3%) needs validation in uptrend/choppy regimes.
3. **Confidence calibration** — Bonus/penalty values are heuristic v1. Need isotonic regression on 200+ complete records.
4. **GEX + war_status rules** — gex_history.db has 1 row. Cannot derive SR rules until 30+ days of GEX data collected.
